  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More than a Woman: Strengthening Women&#x2019;s Participation in Politics and Governance &#x2013; Phase II; The project builds on previous Irish Aid support to SEND SL and seeks to increase women&#x2019;s participation in politics and governance in four districts: Kenema, Kono, Kailahun (Eastern Region) and Bonthe (Southern Region), and also strengthens the organizational capacity of SEND SL for improved programme delivery and overall organizational performance.</narrative>
  </description>
